OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FHeavy,
OL,6,Fthundery showers generally fading from
OL,7,Fthe north during the evening, then
OL,8,Fbecoming largely dry overnight with
OL,9,Fclear spells and light winds. A
OL,10,Fnotably cooler night than of late.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FMostly dry on Friday with a
OL,13,Fgood number of sunny spells. A few
OL,14,Fshowers are possible, but these
OL,15,Flighter and more isolated than on
OL,16,FThursday. Feeling fresher than of late.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
